  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">介紹：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模組為主世界增添了多樣化的建築結構與地下城，豐富您的探索體驗。這些地下城設計包含怪物生成器與藏有戰利品的寶箱，提供資源並創造與環境互動的機會。</p><ul>\n<li>🌳 巨型叢林木</li>\n<li>🏯 廢棄橡木宮殿</li>\n<li>🏰 改良版叢林神廟</li>\n<li>🏰 沼澤神廟</li>\n<li>🏜️ 沙漠神廟遺骸</li>\n<li>🏰 Z型高塔</li>\n<li>🍄 廢棄蘑菇屋</li>\n<li>🏚️ 廢棄工廠</li>\n<li>🏰 女巫城堡&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支援的模組載入器：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我們積極支援 Forge、NeoForge 與 Fabric 模組載入器，版本涵蓋從 1.16.5 到最新版 Minecraft。請透過以下連結選擇您需要的模組載入器：</p><div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本請點此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本請點此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">必要模組：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">請務必安裝以下模組，這些是確保專案正常運作並提供完整體驗的必備項目。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 📦 Ferret 函式庫 </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">相關連結：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">尋找我們的資源並加入社群：</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 連結總覽 </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 GitHub </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/197/bh_ad_see.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-nether-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/192/bh_ad_nether.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-the-end-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/190/bh_ad_end.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/193/bh_ad_ocean.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作夥伴：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本專案榮獲 BisectHosting 鼎力支持。立即體驗他們的服務，以高品質與可靠性輕鬆託管您的專案。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行動呼籲：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有任何疑問需要協助嗎？立即加入我們的 Discord 或造訪 GitHub，與社群互動並參與貢獻！</p>",
